91
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:27,920
Um you just get better results with the higher power lasers than you do a lower power laser.

92
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:33,920
But uh, you know, I've done some very nice holograms using five milliwatts laser, five milliwatt helium neon lasers.

93
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:47,200
I've done uh multiple color holograms using five milliwatt lasers using the triethanoling technique where you pre-sensitize and pre-swell the emulsion before each uh exposure.

94
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:51,760
These weren't large commercial type holograms that you'd find at a convention center.

95
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:59,200
